      "description": "The red autumn fruits of wild roses, rich in vitamin C and full of seeds wrapped in itchy hairs",
      "howTo": "Look on hedgerows, scrub and woodland edges from late August to November; they are softest after the first frosts. Remove the seeds and hairs, which irritate the mouth and gut"
